      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "从节点也可取得安全读位置，\n等自己应用完成后服务读。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "从节点也可取得安全读位置，\n等自己应用完成后服务读。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "spwyk5jKMz0LQwNff-SQx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 764,
      "width": 468,
      "height": 20.7,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#66645d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7830174,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1611085918,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794049815806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "租约读可摊销资格确认，但必须另外证明时间与租约假设。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "租约读可摊销资格确认，但必须另外证明时间与租约假设。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "EshNpc1p7kYiPXBC3zvLw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 103,
      "y": 151.85,
      "width": 294,
      "height": 48.3,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#292824",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1903002754,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1114518402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794049815807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① 新主建立当前任期提交依据\n常用方式：提交当前任期空操作",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jJkLogh8O-hVGLFQB16Jn",
      "originalText": "① 新主建立当前任期提交依据\n常用方式：提交当前任期空操作",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
